    "article_summary": "The article describes the optimization of a photocatalytic C-C bond formation reaction between CH-acidic substrates (like methyl cyanoacetate) and 1,1-diphenylethylene using the organophotocatalyst 4CzIPN. The study utilizes a 3D-printed photoreactor and Design of Experiments (DoE) to improve yields from 43% to 91%, while introducing a modified energy economy factor to assess sustainability and demonstrating scalability via continuous flow synthesis.",
